  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Number of triangles&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts></math><br /><br />Given:<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
